# Local-only, never published: internal changelog, chip/EDA/AIG/GCU notes,
# NCGD/PinEKF source, simulated peer-review transcripts, scratch.
*.local.md
*.local.json
_local/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# What is deliberately NOT ignored, and why
# ----------------------------------------
# An earlier revision of this file excluded the official manifest and the whole
# of results/cryptobench_official/. That made the headline comparison
# unauditable from a clone: a reader could see the frozen bootstrap but not the
# per-structure telemetry it was computed from, and could not recompute either.
# The manifests, labels, telemetry, per-structure predictions and raw P2Rank
# output are all small (about 18 MB together) and are committed for that reason.
# Only inputs that are reproducible byte-for-byte from a pinned hash, and
# derived caches that are reproducible from those inputs, are excluded below.

# Structure coordinates: 185 MB, materialized from RCSB and OSF and verified
# against the SHA-256 pins already committed in the manifests.
#   tools/fetch_official_data.py
data/cryptobench_apo/_osf/
data/cryptobench_apo/official_receptors/
data/cryptobench_apo/train_receptors/

# Derived feature caches: ~700 MB, rebuilt from the receptors above.
#   tools/build_cascade_cache.py, tools/build_expanded_cache.py
data/cryptobench_apo/_*.npz
data/cryptobench_apo/_*.npy
data/cryptobench_apo/_scratch/

# Resumable-run scratch, meaningful only to an interrupted process.
results/**/_scoring_checkpoint.jsonl

# Rust build artefacts for the optional native kernels
native/geoaudit_kernels/target/

# LaTeX build artefacts
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.xdv
